Runtime dependencies
====================

chez-libuv, chez-httparse, uriparse and byte-machine
----------------------------------------------------
https://github.com/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/chez-libuv
https://github.com/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/chez-httparse
https://github.com/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/uriparse
https://github.com/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/byte-machine
Location: vendor/chez-libuv, vendor/chez-httparse, vendor/uriparse and
vendor/chez-httparse/vendor/byte-machine (git submodules, pinned)
Used: the server's libraries import them, and the Akku package depends on
them. Same copyright holder as this project; each is licensed under the BSD
3-Clause License, in its own LICENSE.

Each carries a NOTICE of its own for the third-party software in it.
chez-libuv's names libuv, which its build compiles when it finds no system
libuv 1.48 or newer; a distribution that ships that library ships libuv,
and must carry its notices. chez-httparse's names llhttp, whose HTTP/1
parser it ports.


